     1
    ],
    "frame": "UF",
    "hold": 2,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     0.55
    ],
    "frame": "TF",
    "hold": 3,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "A",
    "frame": "TF",
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: its aerial starts. It is coming in"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "The jump-in",
    "text": [
     "{opp} plays footsies out of reach, then jumps at Fox with an aerial. From the jump on, where it comes down is fixed: it cannot stop or turn back.",
     "That is the moment to attack upward instead of shielding or backing off."
    ],
    "show": {
