        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: its aerial starts. It is coming in"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "Up smash, up tilt",
    "text": [
     "The up smash hits above Fox {7} frames after the C-stick goes up. Press it as the opponent arrives overhead, not when it leaves the ground: too early and it is over before the jump-in gets there.",
     "The up tilt is faster ({5} frames) and reaches behind Fox too: the stick tilted up, not flicked, with A."
    ],
    "show": {
